//----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// GalaxyRP: [Profile UI] the Games panel (the gamesControls group: rpgLmsButton, racemodeButton,
// duelTournamentButton, sniperBattleButton, meleeBattleButton) and its "Games" sidebar button were
// removed here, along with every "hide gamesControls" line the other sidebar buttons carried.
// The remaining mini-game modes are untouched -- racemode, duelmode, snipermode and meleemode
// stay registered in commands[] (g_cmds.c) and are still reachable from the console. RPG LMS is
// the exception: the whole feature, rpglmsmode and rpglmstable included, was removed afterwards.
// The panel bound no cvars and ran no uiScripts, so nothing in codemp/ui or codemp/cgame fed it and
// no ui_* cvar was retired with it.
//----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// List Tab Beginning
//----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


